{"id":"n49225-1-8","stage":3,"title":"세월 · 岁月","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49225-1-8-1","ko":"아직도 아버지의 마음을 잘 모르겠어요.","zh":"我还是不太明白父亲的心意。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아직도","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아버지의","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"2","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마음을","meaning":"心意，心思","explanation":"마음：心意，心思；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"마음","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20911","senseId":"4","lemma":"마음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"清楚地，仔细地","explanation":"잘：清楚地，仔细地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모르겠어요.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"aa9cbf25b5381e2c","term":"마음","zh":"心意，心思","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3","entryId":"20911","definition":"喜爱或关心的心情。","pronunciation":["마음"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"清楚地，仔细地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"分明而准确地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/85577b466bb674f4b138.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49225-1-8-2","ko":"세월이 지나 너도 부모가 되면 알 수 있을 것이다.","zh":"等时间久了，你也成为父母后就会懂了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"세월이","meaning":"岁月，光阴，年华，时光","explanation":"세월：岁月，光阴，年华，时光；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"세월","audio":"/audio/54d9aa79a74486473c4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49225","senseId":"1","lemma":"세월","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지나","meaning":"过，过去","explanation":"지나다：过，过去；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"지나다","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82142","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너도","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부모가","meaning":"父母","explanation":"부모：父母；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"부모","audio":"/audio/881a8172c7dcec2e64dc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29559","senseId":"1","lemma":"부모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되면","meaning":"成为，变为","explanation":"되다：成为，变为；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"1","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있을","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것이다.","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"54d9aa79a7448647","term":"세월","zh":"岁月，光阴，年华，时光","audio":"/audio/54d9aa79a74486473c4b.mp3","entryId":"49225","definition":"流逝的时间。","pronunciation":["세ː월"]},{"id":"7d68e3b7dc1c001c","term":"지나다","zh":"过，过去","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3","entryId":"82142","definition":"随时间流逝，脱离那个时期。","pronunciation":["지나다"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"881a8172c7dcec2e","term":"부모","zh":"父母","audio":"/audio/881a8172c7dcec2e64dc.mp3","entryId":"29559","definition":"父亲和母亲。","pronunciation":["부모"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"成为，变为","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"拥有新的身份或地位。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]}],"audio":"/audio/13c7f6b7d7c758add047.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.037,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=49225","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":102,"sequenceScore":2.6904,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["等时间久了，你也成为父母后就会懂了。","我还是不太明白父亲的心意。","别撒谎了，你怎么那么会撒谎？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我还是不太明白父亲的心意。","别撒谎了，你怎么那么会撒谎？","等时间久了，你也成为父母后就会懂了。"],"answer":2}]}
